{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 38,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O Jehovah, rebuke me not in thy wrath;\nNeither chasten me in thy hot displeasure.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thine arrows stick fast in me,\nAnd thy hand presseth me sore.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There is no soundness in my flesh because of thine indignation;\nNeither is there any health in my bones because of my sin.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For mine iniquities are gone over my head:\nAs a heavy burden they are too heavy for me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My wounds are loathsome and corrupt,\nBecause of my foolishness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I am pained and bowed down greatly;\nI go mourning all the day long.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For my loins are filled with burning;\nAnd there is no soundness in my flesh.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I am faint and sore bruised:\nI have groaned by reason of the disquietness of my heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lord, all my desire is before thee;\nAnd my groaning is not hid from thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My heart throbbeth, my strength faileth me:\nAs for the light of mine eyes, it also is gone from me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My lovers and my friends stand aloof from my plague;\nAnd my kinsmen stand afar off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They also that seek after my life lay snares ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for me",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ";\nAnd they that seek my hurt speak mischievous things,\nAnd meditate deceits all the day long.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I, as a deaf man, hear not;\nAnd I am as a dumb man that openeth not his mouth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yea, I am as a man that heareth not,\nAnd in whose mouth are no reproofs.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For in thee, O Jehovah, do I hope:\nThou wilt answer, O Lord my God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I said, Lest they rejoice over me:\nWhen my foot slippeth, they magnify themselves against me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I am ready to fall,\nAnd my sorrow is continually before me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I will declare mine iniquity;\nI will be sorry for my sin.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But mine enemies are lively, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " are strong;\nAnd they that hate me wrongfully are multiplied.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They also that render evil for good\nAre adversaries unto me, because I follow the thing that is good.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Forsake me not, O Jehovah:\nO my God, be not far from me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.38.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.38.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Make haste to help me,\nO Lord, my salvation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Prayer of a suffering penitent.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "A Psalm of David, Or, to make memorialto bring to remembrance.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
